WEBVTT

00:09:26.854 --> 00:09:30.441
Other women will seek medication abortion,

00:09:30.482 --> 00:09:34.153
using the internet
or gray or black markets

00:09:34.194 --> 00:09:37.656
and subject themselves in some states
to criminal prosecutions.

00:09:37.698 --> 00:09:42.703
Still, other women will carry
their unintended pregnancies to term.

00:09:43.329 --> 00:09:47.041
The bottom line is
this is not a pretty picture.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.085
So what now?

00:09:50.502 --> 00:09:51.712
What can we do?

00:09:51.712 --> 00:09:54.673
We have been saying for five decades,

00:09:54.673 --> 00:09:57.134
"Save Roe, save Roe, save Roe."

00:09:57.176 --> 00:10:01.555
That strategy is no longer feasible.